  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Housing Repair for People&apos;s Empowerment Project  (HOPE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project development objective is to (a) support affected households to regain adequate housing through resilient repair of damaged housing stock; and (b) to support national government in priority climate-resilient policy reforms.</narrative>
  </description>
